    {
      "id": "text-54f0d75b8b2bb1f738f1",
      "classification": "likely-prompt",
      "reviewKind": "prompt-review",
      "value": "<h2>FACS board not recognized</h2><p>The imported file could not be read as a usable image or is too small to cut into 49 cells.</p><p>Use <strong>Create Full FACS Board</strong>, choose a character, generate a visible 7x7 FACS board with Nano Banana, GPT Image 2, or your preferred image aggregator, then import the final image here. Any aspect ratio is OK as long as the 7x7 board is visible.</p>",
