    {
      "id": "text-65c4d1533fff94c730f8",
      "classification": "likely-prompt",
      "reviewKind": "prompt-review",
      "value": "<h2>Create Full FACS Board</h2><p>Best pipe: generate a flat 7x7 contact sheet in portrait <strong>3:4 or 4:5</strong>. 9:16 also works if the board fills the image and is not floating in a big empty poster.</p><p>Ask for: 49 equal cells, thin dark separators or no gutters, no thick white grid lines, no outer margin, one centered portrait per cell, labels kept in a narrow bottom band, same lens/crop/light/background across all tiles. Import that final board here; the app crops inside each cell and ignores the label band.</p><p>Important gaze lock: AU61 must look to <strong>image-left / viewer-left</strong>; AU62 must look to <strong>image-right / viewer-right</strong>. They must be visibly opposite, never mirrored into the same direction.</p>",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "sourcePath": "Barzy App/public/assets/HTML/facs_sheet_generator.html",
          "line": 414,
          "column": 17,
          "kind": "string-literal",
